{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1039812-sarira-the-faceless-maiden","id":1039812,"title":"[Sarira] The Faceless Maiden","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-28T21:13:21-08:00","id":1039812,"title":"[Sarira] The Faceless Maiden","content":"<span style=\"font-size:18px\">The Faceless Maiden (\u2022\u2022\u2022 \u2022\u2022\u2022 \u2022\u2022\u2022)</span><br /> Structure 45, Durability 5, Size 5, Gnosis 5, Mana 90<br /> <br /> Stay away. The Faceless Maiden is not as damaged as she looks - a rose-quartz statue of a naked woman, pristine and perfect except where her face was roughly and rudely broken away.Her owners tend to follow suit - found months later, faces flayed by their own fingernails.<br /> <br /> Just... stay away. She isn't worth it.<br /> <br /> <b>Path:</b> Mastigos<br /> <b>Resonance:</b> Self-Harm, Anonymity, Joy, Agony, Madness, Hatred, Oblivion, Nudity, The Abyss<br /> <b>Spells She Contains:</b> Forge No Chains (\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022), <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/877640-creative-thaumaturgy-fallen-world-edition?p=884183#post884183\">Broken Heartstrings</a> (\u2022\u2022\u2022), <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/877640-creative-thaumaturgy-fallen-world-edition?p=884183#post884183\">Twist Link</a> (Space \u2022\u2022\u2022), <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/877640-creative-thaumaturgy-fallen-world-edition?p=887054#post887054\">Iron Chains</a> (Space \u2022\u2022)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-28T23:12:20-08:00","id":1039841,"title":"","content":"I was checking out her spells, and it says Broken Heartstrings was designed by a Mastigos Banisher. Is there a connection between them and her, is she potentially a banisher sarira? Or are you just using the spell?<br /> <br /> Either way, I like it. Maybe we should have some sort of Collected Fanmade Artifacts stickied.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-29T00:00:55-08:00","id":1039855,"title":"","content":"There's a hint as to who she was in her Resonances.<br /> <br /> As for the Banisher... maybe <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-29T00:17:25-08:00","id":1039860,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>amechra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1039812-sarira-the-faceless-maiden?p=1039855#post1039855\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's a hint as to who she was in her Resonances.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is this someone in real-life history or mythology? Or is she a character mentioned in any of the books?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-29T01:37:34-08:00","id":1039886,"title":"","content":"<b>Short answer:</b> No, I don't <i>think</i> so.<br /> <br /> <b>Long answer:</b> I meant in a more general sense - what kind of person would leave a Resonance for <i>The Abyss</i> and <i>Nudity</i>, of all things? Ask yourself - what <i>was</i> her tenth Resonance\u00b9?<br /> <br /> <b>Longer answer:</b> I have certain &quot;themes&quot; I come back to time and time again - one of them is literal (and figurative) facelessness\u00b2. A prime example is <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/264640-101-archmages?p=386699#post386699\">Nirmukah, That Which Takes Faces</a>, whose original &quot;version&quot; was as a god-engineer in the setting of one of my home D&amp;D games\u00b2. You might have noticed that most of the stuff I write tends to consist of (hopefully) evocative imagery wrapped around a nugget of &quot;this is how this behaves&quot;, without giving a wider context.<br /> <br /> This is intentional.<br /> <br /> I could go on about how this fits into my larger set of writing patterns, my general <i>goals</i> while writing, and how my style has both good and bad aspects\u00b3, but those are a bit off-topic.<br /> <br /> =---=<br /> <br /> \u00b9 Before you ask - no, I don't know the answer.<br /> \u00b2 It had a factory-fortress made of flesh, a powerful goblin empire who believed that heaven lay in their ruler's stomachs, and a war against the gods where the gods <i>lost</i>.<br /> \u00b3 I am <i>absolute shit</i> at dialogue.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-29T03:27:02-08:00","id":1039908,"title":"","content":"This is technically a 10 dot artifact, since dot values round up the cost of individual spells. Both of the 3-dot effects cost 2 dots each.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-29T05:54:20-08:00","id":1039952,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1039812-sarira-the-faceless-maiden?p=1039841#post1039841\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe we should have some sort of Collected Fanmade Artifacts stickied.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd be happy to open up that thread (if it hasn't been done yet). I need someplace to post my Kalpavriksha Sarira when it's fully written anyway.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/foru